verse = \lyricmode {
  There -- fore the \markup { \smallCaps "Lord" } stood up in rage
and he ab -- horred his he -- ri -- tage.
He turned them o -- ver to the nations;
to slav -- er͜y did the \markup { \smallCaps "Lord" } con -- demn
